{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104682","id":2421277087,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6QUcGf","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104682","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104682.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104682.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104682","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104682/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104682/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104682/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/994f41aa78f6cf41b4caa05bb6f4922bd03f4804","number":104682,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add several new physics-related icons","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"While working on my 4D module, I tried to make it very comfy to use, including having docs and icons for everything. There are a few things I made icons for which their 2D and 3D equivalents in the base engine don't have. This PR adds them.\r\n\r\nLeft: Icons in master.\r\nMiddle: Icons that were in this PR when it first opened.\r\nRight: Updated icons thanks to the recommendations from @MewPurPur.\r\n\r\n![new_icons](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2de707be-805f-4d13-b272-0df2ca518a11)\r\n\r\nFrom top to bottom:\r\n- Geometry2D/3D: Inspired by drafting triangles. Can also be interpreted as getting the length of something.\r\n- KinematicCollision2D/3D: Depicts 2 boxes hitting each other, including \"sparks\" for effect.\r\n- CollisionObject2D/3D: Includes the outer ring of StaticBody2D/3D and the inner square of Area2D/3D.\r\n- PhysicsBody2D/3D: Like CollisionObject2D/3D but includes the lines from AnimatableBody2D/3D.\r\n    - Note: CollisionObject2D/3D and PhysicsBody2D/3D are abstract node types, so the icon uses the abstract node color defined in `editor_color_map.cpp`.\r\n    - Note: The 2D abstract color wasn't used in master prior to this PR.\r\n- Shape2D/3D: Previously just the ObjectDisabled icon, now is colored to match the dimension.\r\n    - Note: The individual 3D shapes are currently colored blue, which is a bit odd. I didn't change those.\r\n- World2D/3D: Color to match dimension, and replace the \"paper\" icon of World2D to match 3D.\r\n    - This one may be controversial because of the World2D change, but I think the circle and dot representing a planet and moon is a better icon for \"world\". The paper makes me think of CanvasLayer or something.\r\n\r\nWhen I initially opened this PR, all of these just used the same colors as 2D/3D nodes, but some contributors below expressed that this is not desired. They now have a different set of colors which are slightly different, and these new colors have been added to `editor_color_map.cpp` as well.\r\n\r\nAll icons in the above image are the dark theme version. They look good in light theme too:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"150\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-05-12 at 6 19 22 PM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fd50e5fd-26f6-4732-b481-4700399dcdd9\" />\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"